                  "stats": {
                    "id": "levelled_description_0e4088ac7510",
                    "level": {
                      "value": 16
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You symbiotically combine your form with that of the entity within you, taking a powerful hybrid form to temporarily boost your abilities in combat while maintaining control. For 1 minute, you gain the following effects.\n\n- If you were Medium or smaller, you become Large, and your reach increases to 10 feet.\n- You gain a +2 status bonus to attack and damage rolls and a +1 status bonus on saving throws against spells. If you use Entity's Resurgence, the status bonuses to attack and damage rolls increase to +3 during the time that the two effects overlap.\n- If you have the Entity's Strike feat, the unarmed attack you gained from that feat increases its damage die from 1d6 to 1d8.\n- You gain 40 temporary Hit Points.\n- You gain a fly Speed equal to your Speed."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
